      "name": "InitializeInventorySubPanel",
      "signature": "int InitializeInventorySubPanel(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes the inventory sub-panel by clearing existing children and creating new UI elements.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate string ID 0x147B for localized text\n2. Iterate through existing sub-children array and dispatch handlers to clean them up\n3. Reset g_nNumSubChildren to 0 and restore current input item\n4. Reset g_dwInventorySubState to 0\n5. Create first UI object (button) via factory using g_UITypeInventoryButton template\n6. Store in g_apSubChildrenArray, increment count, set as last inventory item, enable flags\n7. Create second UI object (label) via factory using g_UITypeInventoryLabel template\n8. Store in array, increment count, enable flags\n9. Create third UI object (text box) via factory using g_UITypeInventoryTextBox template\n10. Store in array, increment count, enable flags, add text content\n11. Set g_pfnSubPanelCallback to FUN_6fa06a10 for message processing\n12. Record initialization timestamp in g_dwInventorySubState via GetTickCount\n13. Set g_nSubPanelState to 4 (initialized state)\n14. Stop message loop and return TRUE\n\nParameters:\n  None (void)\n\nReturns:\n  int - Always returns 1 (TRUE) indicating success\n\nLocal Variables (SSA temporaries):\n  iVar1 (nChildIndex): Loop counter for iterating through children\n  puVar2 (pUIObject): Pointer to current UI object being processed/created\n  wszText: Wide string text from ValidateStringId (EBX register)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Assert fires if g_nNumSubChildren >= 0x20 (MAX_CHILDREN = 32) at any creation point\n- Assert calls FUN_6fa12bdd(-1) which does not return\n\nStructure:\n- g_apSubChildrenArray: Array of up to 32 UI object pointers at 0x6fa20a20\n- g_nNumSubChildren: Count of children at 0x6fa21734\n- g_dwInventorySubState: Timestamp/state at 0x6fa2173c\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x147B: String ID for sub-panel text\n- 0x20 (32): MAX_CHILDREN limit\n- 0x1086: Source line number for assert\n- 4: Initialized sub-panel state",
