      "name": "SetInventoryPanelBitMask",
      "signature": "int SetInventoryPanelBitMask(int nBitMask)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Sets or clears a bit mask on the global inventory panel state.\n\nWrapper function that calls D2Win.SetOrClearBitMask with the global\ng_pInventoryPanelState pointer and the specified bit mask value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load global inventory panel state pointer from g_pInventoryPanelState\n2. Call SetOrClearBitMask(g_pInventoryPanelState, nBitMask)\n3. Return 1 (always succeeds)\n\nParameters:\n  nBitMask (ECX) - Bit mask value to set or clear on the panel state\n\nReturns:\n  int - Always returns 1 (success)\n\nCalling Convention: __fastcall (parameter in ECX)\n\nCalled By: FUN_6fa0f650 during dialog/panel initialization\n\nExternal Calls:\n  SetOrClearBitMask (D2WIN.DLL) - Sets or clears bits in a data structure",
