      "signature": "bool ClearInventorySlot8TextField(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Clears inventory slot 8 text field by setting value to -1.\n\nClassification: Callback function - registered as clear handler for inventory slot 8\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load g_dwInventorySlot8 pointer into ECX (fastcall first param)\n2. Set EDX to 0xFFFFFFFF (-1, invalid/clear value)\n3. Call SetTextFieldValue to clear the text field\n4. Return TRUE (1) to indicate success\n\nParameters: None (callback with no parameters)\n\nReturns:\n- TRUE (1): Always returns success\n\nCalled By:\n- Registered as callback at 0x6fa02552 during inventory panel initialization\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- This is a UI callback for clearing text field content\n- The -1 value (0xFFFFFFFF) represents \"no value\" or cleared state",
