      "name": "CharSelectTextBoxAddText",
      "signature": "int CharSelectTextBoxAddText(wchar_t * lpwszText, dword dwContext)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Adds text to the character selection screen text box control.\n\nWrapper function that safely adds text to g_pCharSelectControl by checking\nif the control is initialized before calling TextBoxAddText.\n\nClassification: Wrapper/Thunk\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_pCharSelectControl is non-null\n2. If valid, call TextBoxAddText(g_pCharSelectControl, lpwszText, dwContext, 0)\n3. Return success (1) regardless of whether text was added\n\nParameters:\n  lpwszText (ECX) - Wide string text to add to the text box\n  dwContext (EDX) - Context value passed through to TextBoxAddText (color/formatting)\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Always returns success\n\nCross-References:\n  Called from FUN_6fa06290 (chat command processing)\n  Called from FUN_6fa0c1a0, FUN_6fa0cb60 (network message handlers)\n  14 total callers\n\nGlobals Accessed:\n  g_pCharSelectControl (0x6fa218c8) - Pointer to character select text box control",
