      "name": "InitializeInventoryPanelUI",
      "signature": "int InitializeInventoryPanelUI(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "InitializeInventoryPanelUI - Resets and rebuilds the inventory panel UI state\n\nClassification: Initialization function\nCallers: None detected (may be registered as callback or called via function pointer)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Reset button frame values for all 3 button frames to 0\n2. Call sub-initialization functions (FUN_6fa10090, FUN_6fa0f490)\n3. Dispatch inventory item handlers for inventory slots 1-8 to clear them\n4. Set current input item and pointer from global state\n5. Loop through existing sub-children array, dispatching handlers to clear each\n6. Reset g_nNumSubChildren to 0, clear g_dwInventorySubState\n7. Call FUN_6fa117b0 for additional state reset\n8. Clear g_dwInventoryExtraState, dispatch handlers for slots 9-10\n9. If g_dwSpecialModeFlag == 1, call FUN_6fa127f0 (special mode handler)\n10. If g_dwInventoryPanelMode == 3, reset panel mode to 0\n11. If g_pInventoryPanelState is valid, set bit mask via SetOrClearBitMask\n12. Create 7 child UI objects via CreateObjectByTypeFactory, each with bounds check\n    - Each creation validates g_nNumSubChildren < 32 (0x1f), asserts on overflow\n    - Child object types: g_ChildObjectType1 through g_ChildObjectType7\n    - Objects stored in g_apSubChildrenArray at current index\n13. After creating second child object, call ValidateStringId(0x14c5) and add text\n14. Set final created object as current input item\n15. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  None - Function takes no parameters\n\nReturns:\n  int - Always returns 1 indicating successful initialization\n\nLocal Variables:\n  pnCreatedObject (int *): Pointer to newly created UI child object from factory\n  nLoopIndex (int): Loop counter for iterating sub-children array\n  pdwSlotPtr (uint *): Pointer to current slot in inventory type array during iteration\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Asserts with FogAssert if sub-children count exceeds 31 (max 32 children)\n- Calls FUN_6fa12bdd(0xffffffff) on overflow which does not return\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1f (31): Maximum sub-children index (array size 32)\n- 0x1086: Source line number for assertion\n- 0x14c5: String ID for text box content\n- Panel mode 3: Special mode requiring reset to 0\n\nGlobal State Modified:\n- g_nNumSubChildren: Reset to 0, then incremented 7 times\n- g_dwInventorySubState: Set to 0\n- g_dwInventoryExtraState: Set to 0\n- g_dwInventoryPanelMode: May be set to 0 if was 3\n- g_apSubChildrenArray: Populated with 7 new child objects",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
