      "name": "InitializeOrResetInventoryPanel",
      "signature": "void InitializeOrResetInventoryPanel(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes or resets inventory panel state based on game context.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Reset panel state flags (g_dwPanelResetFlag and slots 1-8) to 0\n2. Reset g_dwInventoryExtraState to 0, set g_szCommandBufferEnd to 1000\n3. Check game list data flag at offset 0x225\n4. If flag set, call Ordinal_10002 (D2Lang.GetLocaleId)\n5. If Ordinal_10002 returns 0 (cleanup path):\n   a. Validate string ID 0x1413 for panel text\n   b. Call panel initialization helpers FUN_6fa10090 and FUN_6fa0f490\n   c. Dispatch inventory handlers for slots 1-8\n   d. Restore current input item and pointer\n   e. Loop through sub-children array, dispatching handlers for each\n   f. Reset g_nNumSubChildren to 0, restore input item again\n   g. Clear g_dwInventorySubState, call FUN_6fa117b0\n   h. Clear g_dwInventoryExtraState, dispatch slots 9-10\n   i. If special mode flag is 1, call FUN_6fa127f0\n   j. If panel mode is 3, reset to 0\n   k. If panel state pointer valid, toggle bit masks (set then clear)\n   l. Reset all button frames to 0\n   m. Create text box, add text, clear callback\n6. Else (initialization path):\n   a. Assert sub-children count < 32 (0x20)\n   b. Create text box from g_TextBoxObjectType1, add to sub-children\n   c. Increment sub-children count, assert < 32 again\n   d. Create text box from g_TextBoxObjectType2, add to sub-children\n   e. Validate string ID 0x14c6, add text to second text box\n   f. Call InitializeCharacterClassSelectionPanel\n   g. Set scroll offset to -2, display mode to 0x23\n   h. Set panel state decrement to 0x10, timer to 1000\n   i. Call Ordinal_10012 (D2Lang.GetCurrentLanguageId)\n\nParameters: None (reads global state)\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Asserts if sub-children count >= 32 (max children exceeded)\n- Two distinct paths: cleanup (Ordinal_10002 returns 0) vs initialization\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x225: Offset into game list data for active flag\n- 0x1413: String ID for cleanup path text\n- 0x14c6: String ID for initialization path text\n- 0x20 (32): Maximum sub-children count\n- 0x1086 (4230): Assert line number\n- 0x23 (35): Panel display mode value\n- 0x10 (16): Panel state decrement value\n- 1000: Timer/command buffer value",
