      "name": "InitializeOrResetCharSelPanel",
      "signature": "void InitializeOrResetCharSelPanel(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes or resets the character selection panel based on game state.\n\nThis function operates in two modes:\n- RESET MODE: When in an active game session (game list flag set, Ordinal_10002 returns 0)\n  cleans up existing panel state, resets all inventory slots, and clears sub-children\n- INIT MODE: Otherwise, creates new text box objects for character selection UI and\n  initializes the character class selection panel\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set panel reset flag to 1 (active reset)\n2. Clear all 8 panel state slots (g_dwPanelStateSlot1-8) to 0\n3. Clear inventory extra state and set command buffer end to 1000\n4. Check if game list data at offset 0x225 is non-zero (active session flag)\n5. If active session, call Ordinal_10002 (D2Multi.IsMultiplayerGame check)\n6. If Ordinal_10002 returns 0 (RESET MODE):\n   a. Validate string ID 0x1413 and call FUN_6fa10090, FUN_6fa0f490\n   b. Dispatch inventory handlers for slots 1-8\n   c. Set current input item and pointer from globals\n   d. Loop through sub-children array, dispatching handlers for each\n   e. Reset sub-children count to 0\n   f. Clear inventory sub-state and call FUN_6fa117b0\n   g. Clear extra state and dispatch slots 9-10\n   h. If special mode flag == 1, call FUN_6fa127f0\n   i. If panel mode == 3, reset to 0\n   j. Toggle bit mask on panel state (set then clear)\n   k. Reset all 4 button frame values to 0\n   l. Create text box and add text, clear callback\n7. Else (INIT MODE):\n   a. Assert sub-children count < 32\n   b. Create first text box from g_TextBoxObjectType1, add to sub-children\n   c. Increment count, assert still < 32\n   d. Create second text box from g_TextBoxObjectType2, add to sub-children\n   e. Increment count\n   f. Validate string ID 0x276A, add text to second text box\n   g. Initialize character class selection panel\n   h. Set scroll offset to -2, display mode to 0x23, state decrement to 0x10\n   i. Set timer value to 1000 and call Ordinal_10012\n\nParameters:\n  None (void) - Function uses only global state\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Assert failure triggers FUN_6fa12bdd(-1) which does not return\n- Maximum sub-children count is 32 (0x20)\n\nOrdinal Calls:\n- Ordinal_10002: D2Multi.IsMultiplayerGame - checks if in multiplayer game\n- Ordinal_10012: D2Multi.SetPanelCallback - sets panel update callback\n\nGlobals Modified:\n- g_dwPanelResetFlag, g_dwPanelStateSlot1-8\n- g_dwInventoryExtraState, g_szCommandBufferEnd\n- g_nNumSubChildren, g_dwInventorySubState\n- g_dwInventoryPanelMode, g_dwInventorySlot9\n- _g_pfnSubPanelCallback (RESET) or _g_dwPanelTimerValue (INIT)\n- g_nPanelScrollOffset, g_byPanelDisplayMode, g_dwPanelStateDecrement",
