      "name": "InitializeChatPanelDisplay",
      "signature": "uint InitializeChatPanelDisplay(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes the chat panel display for class selection UI.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Reset button frame values for all 6 primary panel slots to inactive (0)\n2. If g_dwPanelResetFlag is set, also reset slots 7 and 8\n3. Set slot 2 button frame value to active (1)\n4. Early exit if g_byPanelDisplayFlags is 10 (0x0A) or 1 - panel already configured\n5. Set g_szCommandBufferEnd to 200 (0xC8) for text buffer sizing\n6. Clear existing text data list in g_dwInventoryExtraState\n7. Initialize 4-wchar Unicode buffer on stack via default constructor loop (2 iterations)\n8. Call FUN_6fa12b5e to extract class abbreviation from szNotificationsEnabled+0xA0 table\n9. Convert ANSI class abbreviation to Unicode via win2Unicode\n10. Add converted text lines to inventory extra state panel with color 4\n11. Navigate scrollbar to index 0 (top of list)\n12. Determine base class index from g_byPanelDisplayFlags:\n    - Range 9-16 (0x09-0x10): base = 9\n    - Range 0-7: base = 0\n    - Range 19-26 (0x13-0x1A): base = 19\n    - Range 27-34 (0x1B-0x22): base = 27\n    - Outside ranges: assertion failure\n13. Set g_nPanelScrollOffset to -2 (0xFFFFFFFE)\n14. Set g_fClassListEnabled to 1 (enable class list)\n15. Store base+1 to g_byPanelDisplayFlags, reset g_dwPanelStateA to 0\n\nParameters:\n- None (void)\n\nReturns:\n- 1 (TRUE): Always returns success\n\nGlobals Modified:\n- g_szCommandBufferEnd: Set to 200\n- g_nPanelScrollOffset: Set to -2\n- g_fClassListEnabled: Set to 1\n- g_dwPanelStateA: Set to 0\n- g_byPanelDisplayFlags: Updated to base class index + 1\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Early exit when g_byPanelDisplayFlags is 10 or 1 (panel already initialized)\n- Assertion failure via FogAssert if display flags outside valid ranges\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xC8 (200): Text buffer size limit\n- 0xFFFFFFFE (-2): Initial scroll offset\n- 0xA0 (160): Offset into szNotificationsEnabled for class abbreviation table\n- Class index ranges: 0-7, 9-16, 19-26, 27-34\n\nSource: D2Multi\\Src\\ChatDlg.cpp line 0x15F7 (5623)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
