      "name": "InitializePanelDisplayMode5",
      "signature": "int InitializePanelDisplayMode5(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes panel display mode 5 for character class selection UI.\n\nResets all panel slot button states, clears existing text list, populates with\ncharacter class abbreviation text converted from ANSI to Unicode, then calculates\nand sets the appropriate panel base index based on current display flags range.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Reset button frame values for slots 1-6 to inactive (0)\n2. If panel reset flag is set, also reset slots 7-8 to inactive\n3. Set slot 7 button frame to active (1)\n4. Early exit if display flags == 0x0F or 0x06 (return 1)\n5. Set command buffer size to 200\n6. Clear the inventory extra state text list\n7. Initialize Unicode buffer (2 wide chars) via constructor loop\n8. Convert character class abbreviation string from ANSI to Unicode\n9. Add converted text lines to inventory extra state list\n10. Navigate scrollbar to index 0\n11. Set panel scroll offset to -2 (0xFFFFFFFE)\n12. Enable class list flag\n13. Calculate panel base index from display flags range:\n    - Flags 0x09-0x10: base = 0x09\n    - Flags 0x00-0x07: base = 0x00\n    - Flags 0x13-0x1A: base = 0x13\n    - Flags 0x1B-0x22: base = 0x1B\n    - Otherwise: Assert failure and exit\n14. Store base + 6 as new display flags, clear panel state A\n15. Return 1\n\nParameters: None (stdcall, no arguments)\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Always returns success\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Display flags 0x0F or 0x06 trigger early return without text initialization\n  - Invalid display flag range triggers FogAssert at line 0x15F7\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0xC8 (200) - Command buffer size\n  0xFFFFFFFE (-2) - Panel scroll offset sentinel\n  0x06 - Offset added to base index for final display flags\n  szNotificationsEnabled + 0xA0 - Character class abbreviation string table\n\nGlobal State Modified:\n  g_szCommandBufferEnd - Set to 200\n  g_nPanelScrollOffset - Set to -2\n  g_fClassListEnabled - Set to 1\n  g_dwPanelStateA - Cleared to 0\n  g_byPanelDisplayFlags - Updated with calculated base + 6",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:b51e9a2f8dbb21f72b76d827dcaa0081",
