      "comment": "Thunk handler that resets UI state and returns success.\n\nClassification: Thunk/Wrapper - wraps FUN_6fa127f0 for callback use\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FUN_6fa127f0 to reset inventory panel handlers and UI input state\n2. Return 1 (TRUE) indicating success\n\nParameters:\n- pUnused (void *): Callback parameter, unused by this handler\n\nReturns:\n- 1 (TRUE): Always returns success\n\nCalled From:\n- Function pointer table at 0x6fa1cd90 (callback registration)\n\nWraps:\n- FUN_6fa127f0: Dispatches inventory item handlers, clears special mode flag,\n  sets current input item to BNet UI object index 10",
