      "name": "ProcessBnetAdvertisementData",
      "signature": "int ProcessBnetAdvertisementData(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Processes Battle.net advertisement data received via callback.\n\nClassification: Callback/Handler - invoked through vtable dispatch.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call callback vtable method at offset 0x24 to retrieve ad message data into stack frame\n2. If callback returns 0 (no data), return 0 immediately\n3. Switch on nMessageType:\n   - Case 0: Process string handler - calculate string length via REPNE SCASB,\n             dispatch to handler function from g_apfnBnetAdHandlers[dwParam] if dwParam < 0x18\n   - Case 2: Copy string - copy 16 bytes from dwParam buffer to g_szBnetAdCopyBuffer\n   - Case 3: Play video advertisement:\n     a. Cleanup existing UI object via CleanupUnitType9\n     b. Get temp path via GetTempPathA, fallback to \".\" if fails\n     c. Create temp filename with \"BNetAd\" prefix via GetTempFileNameA\n     d. Delete previous temp file at g_szBnetAdTempPath\n     e. Create new temp file for write (CREATE_ALWAYS, FILE_FLAG_DELETE_ON_CLOSE)\n     f. Write video data (pvStack_318, DStack_314 bytes) to temp file\n     g. Close file handle\n     h. Extract file extension from pcStack_320 via strrchr('.')\n     i. Call FUN_6fa1350c with extension character\n     j. Initialize Smacker video player with temp file path\n     k. Copy temp path to g_szBnetAdTempPath for later cleanup\n     l. Store dwParam in g_dwBnetAdParam\n     m. Release two pool allocations\n4. Return 1 on success\n\nParameters: (IMPLICIT - populated by callback)\n  nMessageType [ESP+0x0]: Message type selector (0=string handler, 2=copy, 3=video)\n  dwParam [ESP+0x8]: Parameter value or buffer pointer depending on message type\n  pcStack_320 [ESP+0x10]: Pointer to source filename with extension\n  DStack_314 [ESP+0x1C]: Size of video data in bytes\n  pvStack_318 [ESP+0x18]: Pointer to video data buffer\n\nReturns:\n  0 - Callback returned no data\n  1 - Message processed successfully\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Message type 0 with dwParam >= 0x18: Silently ignored, returns 1\n  - Message type 0 with NULL handler: Silently ignored, returns 1\n  - GetTempPathA failure: Falls back to \".\" (current directory)\n  - CreateFileWrapper failure (returns -1): Skips write but continues processing\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x24 - Callback vtable offset for GetAdData method\n  0x18 - Maximum handler index in g_apfnBnetAdHandlers table (24 handlers)\n  0x10 - Copy buffer size for message type 2\n  0x104 - MAX_PATH (260 bytes) for temp path buffers\n  0x40000000 - GENERIC_WRITE for CreateFile\n  0x4 - CREATE_ALWAYS disposition\n  0x8000000 - FILE_FLAG_DELETE_ON_CLOSE\n  0x2e - ASCII '.' for extension search\n  0x36a, 0x36b - Pool allocation IDs for ReleasePoolAllocation",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
