      "comment": "Returns pointer to the game list head global variable.\n\nClassification: Getter/Accessor (Leaf function)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load address of g_pGameListHead into EAX\n2. Return pointer to caller\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns:\n- uint * - Pointer to g_pGameListHead global (linked list head for game entries)\n\nCallers: 1 call site at 0x6fa0266b\nUsed by game list management functions (FUN_6fa0b8a0, FUN_6fa0c2f0) for:\n- Iterating game list entries\n- Adding new game entries to linked list\n- Clearing game list on cleanup\n\nMemory Model:\n- Returns pointer to static global data\n- Caller does not own returned pointer\n- Lifetime: Valid for program duration",
