      "name": "ResetBnetGameListAndButtonStates",
      "signature": "void ResetBnetGameListAndButtonStates(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Resets the Battle.net game list UI state and updates button visibility.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If chat history buffer exists with selected unit at offset 0x9c:\n   a. Assert unit pointer is non-null (line 0x7d1)\n   b. Get unit ID and clear selection flag via WriteValueToPointer\n   c. Clear g_pChatHistoryBuffer and set g_nSelectedSlotIndex to -1\n2. Get edit box text from g_pCurrentInputPointer\n3. Set fHasText flag if edit box has non-empty text (Unicode::strlen > 0)\n4. Update UI button states based on fHasText:\n   - g_apBnetUIObjects[5] and [0] - enabled if text exists\n   - g_apBnetUIObjects[1] - enabled if text AND selection exist\n5. Check selection unit flags via GetUnitIdFromPointer:\n   - Extract flag at gdwBitMasks_exref+0x24 (bit 9, 0x200)\n   - g_apBnetUIObjects[3] - enabled if selection exists but flag clear\n   - g_apBnetUIObjects[4] - enabled if selection AND flag set\n6. Release all game list entries:\n   - Iterate g_pGameListHead linked list (next at +0xa0)\n   - Release composite unit at +0x9c, clear pointer\n   - Free each node via ReleasePoolAllocation\n   - Set g_pGameListHead to 0\n7. Release all channel list entries:\n   - Iterate g_pChannelListHead linked list (next at +0x44)\n   - Free each node via ReleasePoolAllocation\n   - Set g_pChannelListHead and g_pChannelListTail to 0\n8. Reset g_dwAutomapLineCount to 0\n9. Format empty game count text with szFmtGameCount\n10. Initialize Unicode buffer (576 elements, 0x240)\n11. Convert ANSI buffer to Unicode via win2Unicode\n12. Update game list display via SetGameListText\n13. Calculate scroll position based on line count:\n    - If lineCount <= 11: scroll position = 0\n    - If lineCount > 11: max scroll = lineCount - 11\n    - Set fCanScrollUp and fCanScrollDown flags\n14. If scroll position non-zero, call RenderBnetListVisibleItems\n15. Update scroll button states:\n    - g_apBnetUIObjects[0xb,0xd] - up arrows enabled by fCanScrollUp\n    - g_apBnetUIObjects[0xc,0xe] - down arrows enabled by fCanScrollDown\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Asserts if g_pChatHistoryBuffer exists but unit pointer at +0x9c is null\n  - Scroll buttons only enabled when game list exceeds 11 visible items (12+)\n\nStructure Layout (Game List Node):\n  Offset  Size  Field           Type        Description\n  0x9c    4     pCompositeUnit  void *      Composite unit handle\n  0xa0    4     pNextEntry      void *      Next node in linked list\n\nStructure Layout (Channel List Node):\n  Offset  Size  Field           Type        Description\n  0x44    4     pNextEntry      void *      Next node in linked list\n\nUI Object Indices:\n  0     - Send button (enabled with text)\n  1     - Action button (enabled with text AND selection)\n  3     - Whisper button (enabled with selection, no friend flag)\n  4     - Friend button (enabled with selection AND friend flag)\n  5     - Text indicator (enabled with text)\n  0xb   - Scroll up button (game list)\n  0xc   - Scroll down button (game list)\n  0xd   - Scroll up button (channel list)\n  0xe   - Scroll down button (channel list)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x7d1  - Assert line number (2001)\n  0x9c   - Offset to unit pointer in game list entry\n  0xa0   - Offset to next pointer in game list entry\n  0x44   - Offset to next pointer in channel list entry\n  0x28   - Offset in gdwInvBitMasks_exref for clear mask\n  0x24   - Offset in gdwBitMasks_exref for friend flag (bit 9)\n  0x240  - Unicode buffer element count (576)\n  0xb    - Visible game list item count threshold (11)\n  0xc    - Line count threshold for scroll (12)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:0d0415ade629765285646a2f4aef61b5",
