      "name": "InitiateGameListRequest",
      "signature": "void InitiateGameListRequest(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "InitiateGameListRequest - Initiates a game list request for multiplayer game browsing\n\nClassification: Worker function - prepares request parameters and dispatches to D2MCPCLIENT\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set inventory panel mode to 3 (game list view)\n2. Reset game list count to 0\n3. Check difficulty mode byte at g_pGameListData+0x356\n4. If difficulty != 0x02 (Nightmare): delegate to FetchAndFilterGameListByDifficulty and return\n5. For Hell difficulty (0x02): zero 24-byte request buffer (6 DWORDs via REP STOSD)\n6. Check expansion flag bit 0x04 at g_pGameListData+0x1EA\n7. If expansion flag set: OR dwRequestFlags with 0x800 (expansion filter flag)\n8. Increment g_wSessionRequestId until non-zero (handles wraparound)\n9. Call D2MCPCLIENT.Ordinal_10006 to send game list request\n10. Save current session ID to g_wLastSessionRequestId for response matching\n\nParameters: None (void function)\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Non-Hell difficulty: Delegates to FetchAndFilterGameListByDifficulty\n- Session ID wraparound: Loop ensures ID is never 0 after increment\n\nGlobal State Modified:\n- g_dwInventoryPanelMode: Set to 3 (game list panel)\n- g_nGameListCount: Reset to 0\n- g_wSessionRequestId: Incremented (non-zero guaranteed)\n- g_wLastSessionRequestId: Updated to match sent request\n\nFlag Bits at offset 0x1EA:\n- 0x04: Expansion mode flag (triggers 0x800 in request flags)\n\nRequest Flags:\n- 0x800: Expansion-only games filter\n\nOrdinal Calls:\n- Ordinal_10006 (D2MCPCLIENT.DLL): Sends game list request to server\n\nCalled By: Single caller at 0x6fa03812\nCalls: FetchAndFilterGameListByDifficulty, D2MCPCLIENT.Ordinal_10006",
