      "name": "OnGameListSelectionClick",
      "signature": "int OnGameListSelectionClick(int nMsgInfo)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "OnGameListSelectionClick - Handles user click events on the game list selection control.\n\nClassification: Event Handler/Callback\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get currently selected game index from text control\n2. Clear secondary game list display\n3. If no valid selection (0xFFFFFFFF), return early\n4. Check if this is a double-click:\n   a. Message type must be WM_LBUTTONDOWN (0x201)\n   b. Same item as last click (compare indices)\n   c. Within 501ms (0x1F5) of last click\n5. If double-click detected, call FUN_6fa10b50 (join game handler) and return\n6. Save current tick count and selected index for next click comparison\n7. Check network status via Ordinal_10002 (D2Multi network check)\n8. If network available (non-zero):\n   a. Get selected item's Unicode name from text control\n   b. Convert Unicode to ANSI in local buffer\n   c. Increment session request ID (avoiding zero)\n   d. Copy game name to global buffer\n   e. Set pending session request ID\n   f. Update game name edit box\n9. If network unavailable (local mode):\n   a. Get game description from g_aszGameListDescriptions array\n   b. Calculate string length (inline strlen)\n   c. If description not empty, display in secondary control\n   d. Get game name from g_aGameListEntriesSource array\n   e. Set game name in edit box\n\nParameters:\n  pMsgInfo (int) - Pointer to message info structure\n    +0x04: Message type (0x201 = WM_LBUTTONDOWN)\n\nReturns:\n  int - Always returns 0\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Double-click threshold: 501ms (0x1F5)\n  - Invalid selection: 0xFFFFFFFF\n  - Game entry stride: 0x3B (59 bytes)\n  - Game name offset within entry: +1 byte\n\nGlobals Modified:\n  g_dwLastSelectedGameIndex - Tracks last clicked index\n  g_dwLastClickTickCount - Tracks last click time\n  g_szSelectedGameName - Stores selected game name (256 bytes)\n  g_wSessionRequestId - Incremented request ID\n  g_nPendingSessionRequestId - Pending request tracking",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
