      "name": "InitializeMotdPanelControls",
      "signature": "void InitializeMotdPanelControls(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes Message of the Day (MOTD) panel UI controls for multiplayer menu.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Create MOTD title text box from g_MotdTextBoxDesc descriptor\n2. Create header text box from DAT_6fa1cda0 descriptor\n3. Load string ID 0x141e and set as header text\n4. Create content text box from DAT_6fa1cdd0 descriptor\n5. Load string ID 0x2a44 and set as content text\n6. Append URL parameter suffix to content text box\n7. Initialize 200-element Unicode array (aUStack_190) for message buffer\n8. Initialize 100-element Unicode array (aUStack_258) for difficulty buffer\n9. Get current difficulty level via Ordinal_10050 (D2Client.GetDifficultyLevel)\n10. Format difficulty level as string using \"%d \" format\n11. Convert difficulty string to Unicode (max 50 chars)\n12. Load string ID 0x2a47 (difficulty label prefix) and copy to message buffer\n13. Load string ID 0x0f9a (separator) and append to message buffer\n14. Initialize 3-element Unicode array for number formatting\n15. Format \"0\" using wsprintf with \"%d\" format\n16. Convert to Unicode and append to message buffer\n17. Append difficulty string to complete the message\n18. Add formatted message to content text box\n19. Create input field from DAT_6fa1ce30 descriptor\n20. Set input field as current input item\n21. Create OK button from DAT_6fa1ce60 descriptor\n22. Clear inventory panel bit mask (disable inventory panel)\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns: void\n\nString IDs:\n- 0x141e: MOTD header text\n- 0x2a44: MOTD content/body text\n- 0x2a47: Difficulty label prefix\n- 0x0f9a: Text separator\n\nGlobal UI Controls Created:\n- g_pMotdTitleTextBox (0x6fa3e8ec): Main title text box\n- g_pMotdHeaderTextBox (0x6fa3e8f0): Header text box\n- g_pMotdContentTextBox (0x6fa3e8f4): Content/body text box\n- g_pMotdInputField (0x6fa3e948): User input field\n- g_pMotdOkButton (0x6fa3e928): Confirmation button\n\nCalled by: Panel initialization sequence (xrefs from 0x6fa10b1e, 0x6fa0f83d, 0x6fa0f7f5)",
