      "name": "InitializeGameListPanelControls",
      "signature": "void InitializeGameListPanelControls(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Initializes UI controls for the Battle.net game list panel.\n\nClassification: Initialization function - sets up game list UI components\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate game list data pointer via GetGameListDataPointer()\n2. Return early with error dialog (string ID 0x1413) if data unavailable\n3. Check additional condition via Ordinal_10052\n4. If check passes, call InitializeMotdPanelControls() and return\n5. Clear byte at offset 0x20B in global structure (unknown flag)\n6. Create textbox controls using CreateObjectByTypeFactory() with configs:\n   - Config at 0x6fa1bcc0 -> stored at g_pTextBox1 (0x6fa3e8ec)\n   - Config at 0x6fa1bcf0 -> stored at g_pTextBox2 (0x6fa3e8f0)\n   - Config at 0x6fa1bd20 -> stored at g_pTextBox3 (0x6fa3e8f4)\n   - Additional configs for more controls\n7. Initialize text content for controls using string IDs:\n   - 0x141E (5150), 0x149A (5274), 0x1488 (5256), 0x1489 (5257)\n   - 0x148B (5259), 0x148C (5260), 0x148A (5258), 0x1F27 (7975)\n8. Set up listbox/button controls for game list interaction\n9. Configure callback handlers and control relationships\n10. Initialize scroll and selection state\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns: void (implicit success/failure via global state)\n\nGlobals Modified:\n- g_pTextBox1 at 0x6fa3e8ec - First textbox control\n- g_pTextBox2 at 0x6fa3e8f0 - Second textbox control\n- Multiple control pointers in 0x6fa3e8xx range\n\nCallers:\n- FUN_6fa11080: Called after ResetInventoryPanelState(), before button frame setup\n\nNote: Function body appears truncated in Ghidra - actual span is 0x6fa0f810-0x6fa1008b.\nDecompilation fails due to function body issue; documented from byte analysis.",
