      "name": "ResetBnetUIElements",
      "signature": "void ResetBnetUIElements(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Resets all Battle.net UI elements to their default state.\n\nCalled during panel initialization and state transitions to dispatch\ninventory item handlers for all Bnet UI widgets, then sets the default\ninput focus and restores the default input pointer.\n\nClassification: Initialization/Cleanup function\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Dispatch inventory item handler for MOTD text boxes (title, header, content)\n2. Dispatch handler for game action buttons (cancel, create, join)\n3. Dispatch handler for max players controls (text boxes 1-2)\n4. Dispatch handler for game info labels (name, password, difficulty, max players)\n5. Dispatch handler for max players input field\n6. Dispatch handler for MOTD OK button and input field\n7. Dispatch handler for max players toggle button\n8. Dispatch handler for game list panel and scroll controls (up, down)\n9. Dispatch handler for game description panel\n10. Dispatch handler for refresh button and character info panel\n11. Dispatch handler for difficulty buttons (1, 2)\n12. Dispatch handler for game name and password edit boxes\n13. Dispatch handler for max player edit boxes (1, 2)\n14. Dispatch handler for ladder and expansion toggles\n15. Set current input item to g_apBnetUIObjects[10]\n16. Tail-call to RestoreDefaultInputPointer\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns: void (no return value)\n\nCallers: EnterBattleNetMultiplayerUI, InitializePanelMode2, \nInitializeOrResetCharSelPanel, ResetInventoryPanelState, and 28+ others\n\nGlobal Data:\n- g_pMotdTitleTextBox (0x6fa3e8ec) - MOTD title text box pointer\n- g_pMotdHeaderTextBox (0x6fa3e8f0) - MOTD header text box pointer\n- g_pMotdContentTextBox (0x6fa3e8f4) - MOTD content text box pointer\n- g_pBnetGameCancelButton (0x6fa3e8f8) - Cancel button pointer\n- g_pBnetGameCreateButton (0x6fa3e8fc) - Create button pointer\n- g_pBnetGameJoinButton (0x6fa3e900) - Join button pointer\n- g_pMaxPlayersTextBox1 (0x6fa3e904) - Max players text box 1\n- g_pMaxPlayersTextBox2 (0x6fa3e908) - Max players text box 2\n- g_pBnetLadderToggle (0x6fa3e90c) - Ladder toggle pointer\n- g_pBnetExpansionToggle (0x6fa3e910) - Expansion toggle pointer\n- g_pBnetGameNameEditBox (0x6fa3e914) - Game name edit box pointer\n- g_pBnetPasswordEditBox (0x6fa3e918) - Password edit box pointer\n- g_pMaxPlayersEditBox1 (0x6fa3e91c) - Max players edit box 1\n- g_pMaxPlayersEditBox2 (0x6fa3e920) - Max players edit box 2\n- g_pDifficultyButton2 (0x6fa3e924) - Difficulty button 2 pointer\n- g_pMotdOkButton (0x6fa3e928) - MOTD OK button pointer\n- g_pBnetGameNameLabel (0x6fa3e92c) - Game name label pointer\n- g_pBnetPasswordLabel (0x6fa3e930) - Password label pointer\n- g_pBnetDifficultyLabel (0x6fa3e934) - Difficulty label pointer\n- g_pBnetMaxPlayersLabel (0x6fa3e938) - Max players label pointer\n- g_pMaxPlayersInputField (0x6fa3e93c) - Max players input field\n- g_pMaxPlayersToggleButton (0x6fa3e940) - Max players toggle button\n- g_pDifficultyButton1 (0x6fa3e944) - Difficulty button 1 pointer\n- g_pMotdInputField (0x6fa3e948) - MOTD input field pointer\n- g_pBnetGameListPanel (0x6fa3e94c) - Game list panel pointer\n- g_pBnetGameListScrollUp (0x6fa3e950) - Game list scroll up button\n- g_pBnetGameListScrollDown (0x6fa3e954) - Game list scroll down button\n- g_pBnetGameDescriptionPanel (0x6fa3e958) - Game description panel\n- g_pBnetRefreshButton (0x6fa3e95c) - Refresh button pointer\n- g_pBnetCharInfoPanel (0x6fa3e960) - Character info panel pointer\n- g_apBnetUIObjects (0x6fa216d0) - Array of Bnet UI object pointers",
