      "comment": "Validates Battle.net game creation form fields and enables/disables the OK button.\n\nClassification: Worker function - validates UI form input before game creation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize validation flags: dwGameNameValid=0, fMaxPlayersValid=false, fInputFieldValid=false\n2. Get game name from g_pBnetGameNameLabel edit box\n3. If game name exists:\n   a. Convert Unicode to ANSI (max 16 chars) into abStringBuffer\n   b. Calculate string length using SCASB.REPNE (strlen equivalent)\n   c. Check name doesn't start with space (0x20)\n   d. Check name has length > 0\n   e. Check name doesn't end with space\n   f. If all pass, set dwGameNameValid=1\n4. Call Ordinal_10002 (D2Multi expansion check)\n5. If expansion mode disabled (returns 0):\n   - Set fMaxPlayersValid=true (no validation needed)\n6. Else (expansion mode enabled):\n   a. Get max players from g_pBnetMaxPlayersLabel edit box\n   b. Convert to ANSI (max 3 chars)\n   c. If string not empty:\n      - Set fMaxPlayersValid=true\n      - Parse string to integer with ParseStringToInt\n      - If value < 1 or > 8, clamp to [1,8] and update edit box\n   d. Check if g_pMaxPlayersToggleButton is valid/enabled\n   e. If toggle enabled:\n      - Get value from g_pMaxPlayersInputField\n      - Convert to ANSI and parse to int\n      - If empty or negative, skip to LAB_6fa106d5 (fail)\n7. Set fInputFieldValid=true (reached via all valid paths)\n8. Calculate final result: (dwGameNameValid && fMaxPlayersValid && fInputFieldValid) ? 1 : 0\n9. Call SetUnitBitMask on g_pMotdOkButton with result to enable/disable\n\nParameters: None (reads from global UI control pointers)\n\nReturns: void (modifies g_pMotdOkButton state via SetUnitBitMask)\n\nGlobals Accessed:\n- g_pBnetGameNameLabel (0x6fa3e92c): Game name edit box control\n- g_pBnetMaxPlayersLabel (0x6fa3e938): Max players label/edit box\n- g_pMaxPlayersToggleButton (0x6fa3e940): Toggle for custom max players\n- g_pMaxPlayersInputField (0x6fa3e93c): Custom max players input field\n- g_pMotdOkButton (0x6fa3e928): OK button to enable/disable\n- unicode2Win function pointer at 0x6fa1904c\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Game name with leading/trailing spaces is invalid\n- Empty game name is invalid\n- Max players clamped to range [1,8]\n- In non-expansion mode, max players validation skipped\n\nCallers: ValidateGameCreationFieldsCallback, ValidateGameCreationFieldsWrapper, \n         UpdateMaxPlayersToggleState (2 variants), FUN_6fa10590",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
