      "name": "InitializeProfileEditPanel",
      "signature": "void InitializeProfileEditPanel(char * lpszCharacterName, dword dwSlotIndex, dword dwUnknownParam)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Initializes the profile editing panel UI for Battle.net user profiles.\n\nCalled when a game slot button is clicked to edit user profile information.\nCreates and configures multiple edit fields for profile data entry.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get pointer to game list data at offset 0x88 (profile name string)\n2. Disable button frames for UI objects 6-9 (clear previous state)\n3. Call ShowProfileSexSelectionPanel to parse existing profile data into buffers\n4. If profile data parsed successfully:\n   a. Reset inventory panel state\n   b. Set profile edit state to 2 (editing mode)\n   c. Create UI object for unknown purpose (type 0x6fa1c8f0)\n   d. Create name display object, convert profile name to Unicode\n   e. Create location edit field, set max length 8, populate with data\n   f. Create age edit field, set max length 4, set validation callback\n   g. Create description edit field, set max length 40 (0x28)\n   h. Create bio edit field, set max length 200 (0xC8)\n   i. Create input item and additional UI objects\n   j. Conditionally create optional button if g_dwButtonFrame1State is 0\n   k. Create 6 text labels with string IDs 0x1492-0x1497\n   l. Link edit fields in circular doubly-linked list for tab navigation\n   m. Set focus to appropriate edit field based on existing data\n   n. Copy character name to global buffer using optimized memcpy\n   o. Store slot index and unknown parameter in globals\n\nParameters:\n  lpszCharacterName (ECX): ANSI string - character name to display\n  dwSlotIndex (EDX): Slot index in game list\n  dwUnknownParam (Stack+4): Unknown parameter, stored to global\n\nReturns: void\n\nString IDs Used:\n  0x1492 - Profile title label\n  0x1493 - Label 1 (likely \"Location\")\n  0x1494 - Label 2 (likely \"Age\")\n  0x1495 - Label 3 (likely \"Sex\")\n  0x1496 - Label 4 (likely \"Description\")\n  0x1497 - Label 5 (likely \"Bio\")\n\nEdit Field Max Lengths:\n  Location: 8 characters\n  Age: 4 characters\n  Description: 40 characters (0x28)\n  Bio: 200 characters (0xC8)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If all profile fields are empty, focus goes to location edit\n  - If any profile field has data, focus goes to bio edit and initializes screenshot config",
