      "name": "SubmitProfileEditData",
      "signature": "int SubmitProfileEditData(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Submits profile edit data by collecting text from edit boxes and invoking callback.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_dwProfileEditState equals 2 (edit mode active)\n2. If not in edit mode, skip to step 10\n3. Get Unicode text from location edit box via D2Win_GetEditBoxChild\n4. Get Unicode text from age edit box\n5. Get Unicode text from description edit box\n6. Get Unicode text from bio edit box\n7. Calculate profile context pointer (g_pGameListData + 0x88)\n8. Convert all Unicode strings to Windows ANSI encoding via unicode2Win\n   - Location: max 8 chars, Age: max 4 chars\n   - Description: max 40 (0x28) chars, Bio: max 200 chars\n9. Invoke InvokeProfileSexCallback with context and converted strings\n10. If callback returned 0, return success (1)\n11. Call ResetProfileEditPanelAndRestoreInput to clean up UI\n12. Return success (1)\n\nParameters:\n  None - Function reads from global edit box pointers\n\nReturns:\n  int - Always returns 1 (success)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Function always returns 1 regardless of callback result\n- If not in edit state (g_dwProfileEditState != 2), only resets panel\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 2: Profile edit state indicating edit mode active\n- 0x88: Offset into g_pGameListData for profile context\n- 8, 4, 0x28, 200: Maximum character lengths for location, age, description, bio\n\nCalled From:\n- Callback table at 0x6fa1cc70 (likely UI button handler)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:190b4a8151085f2deaa95b33724e78d3",
