      "name": "SetCrtRandomSeed",
      "signature": "void SetCrtRandomSeed(uint dwSeed)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Sets the random seed for the C runtime rand() function.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetThreadLocalCrtData() to get pointer to thread-local CRT data structure\n2. Store dwSeed at offset 0x14 (index 5) in the CRT data structure\n\nParameters:\n- dwSeed: Random seed value (typically from GetTickCount)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nThread-Local CRT Data Layout (partial):\nOffset  Size  Field         Description\n0x00    4     dwThreadId    Current thread ID\n0x04    4     dwHandle      Thread handle (-1 typically)\n0x08    4     (reserved)    \n0x0C    4     (reserved)\n0x10    4     (reserved)\n0x14    4     dwRandSeed    Random number generator seed\n\nCalled By:\n- AddOrUpdateBnetGameEntry: Seeds RNG with GetTickCount before rand() calls",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
