      "name": "InitializeTlsBlockDefaults",
      "signature": "void InitializeTlsBlockDefaults(uint * pTlsBlock)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Initialize default values in a CRT thread-local storage data block\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store pointer to g_DefaultTlsBlockData at offset 0x50 of TLS block\n2. Set initialization flag to 1 at offset 0x14 of TLS block\n3. Return (void function)\n\nParameters:\n  pTlsBlock (uint *) - Pointer to allocated 0x74-byte TLS data block\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nTLS Block Fields Modified:\n  Offset  Size  Field              Description\n  0x14    4     dwInitializedFlag  Set to 1 to mark block as initialized\n  0x50    4     pDefaultData       Set to g_DefaultTlsBlockData (0x6fa1e398)\n\nCallers:\n  - InitializeCrtThreadLocalStorage: During DLL_PROCESS_ATTACH\n  - GetThreadLocalCrtData: When allocating new TLS block for thread",
