      "name": "CRT_DestroyHeapSystem",
      "signature": "void CRT_DestroyHeapSystem(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "CRT Heap System Destruction - Frees all heap regions and destroys the CRT heap\n\nThis cleanup function is the counterpart to CRT_InitializeHeapSystem. It releases\nall memory allocated by the CRT heap system based on which heap implementation\ntype was selected (type 3 = region-based, type 2 = small block heap).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check g_dwCrtHeapType for heap implementation type\n2. If type 3 (region-based heap):\n   a. Initialize loop counter to 0\n   b. If g_nHeapRegionCount > 0, iterate through heap regions\n   c. For each region: get region descriptor at offset +0xC from array base\n   d. VirtualFree with MEM_DECOMMIT (0x4000) and size 0x100000 (1MB)\n   e. VirtualFree with MEM_RELEASE (0x8000) to release address space\n   f. HeapFree the region metadata from g_hCrtHeap\n   g. Advance to next region (stride = 0x14 = 20 bytes per descriptor)\n   h. Increment counter and repeat while counter < g_nHeapRegionCount\n   i. HeapFree the entire region array (g_pHeapRegionArray)\n3. If type 2 (small block heap):\n   a. Start at g_SmallBlockHeapListHead (circular linked list)\n   b. For each node: check if field at offset +0x10 (committed memory) is non-NULL\n   c. If non-NULL, VirtualFree with MEM_RELEASE (0x8000)\n   d. Follow linked list pointer at offset 0 to next node\n   e. Repeat until returning to list head\n4. Call HeapDestroy to destroy g_hCrtHeap\n\nParameters:\n  None - This function takes no parameters\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nGlobals Read:\n  g_dwCrtHeapType - Heap implementation type (2=small block, 3=region)\n  g_nHeapRegionCount - Number of allocated heap regions (type 3)\n  g_pHeapRegionArray - Pointer to region descriptor array (type 3)\n  g_SmallBlockHeapListHead - Head of circular linked list (type 2)\n  g_hCrtHeap - Handle to the CRT heap being destroyed\n\nHeap Region Descriptor Layout (type 3, 20 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field\n  0x00    4     Unknown\n  0x04    4     Unknown\n  0x08    4     Unknown\n  0x0C    4     pVirtualMemory - Committed virtual memory pointer\n  0x10    4     pMetadata - Heap-allocated metadata pointer\n\nSmall Block List Node Layout (type 2):\n  Offset  Size  Field\n  0x00    4     pNext - Pointer to next node in circular list\n  0x10    4     pCommittedMemory - Virtual memory to release (may be NULL)\n\nSSA Temporaries (register-based, cannot be renamed):\n  iVar1 (nRegionIndex): Loop counter for region iteration (EBX)\n  puVar2 (pRegionDesc): Pointer to current region descriptor (ESI)\n  ppuVar3 (pListNode): Pointer to current list node (ESI)\n\nCalled By:\n  CrtDllMainHandler - During DLL_PROCESS_DETACH cleanup",
