      "name": "BuildCodePageCaseMapTable",
      "signature": "void BuildCodePageCaseMapTable(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Builds case mapping table for current code page locale.\n\nInitializes g_abCaseMapTable[256] with uppercase/lowercase mappings for all\n256 byte values based on current code page. Sets corresponding character type\nflags (0x10=uppercase, 0x20=lowercase) in g_abCharTypeTable.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetCPInfo to get code page information\n2. If GetCPInfo succeeds:\n   a. Initialize aszCharTable[0..255] with identity mapping (each byte = index)\n   b. Set aszCharTable[0] = ' ' (space for null byte)\n   c. For each lead byte range in DBCS code pages, fill range with spaces\n   d. Call GetStringTypeWithCodePage to get character type flags (CT_CTYPE1)\n   e. Call LCMapStringWithFallback with LCMAP_UPPERCASE to get uppercase map\n   f. Call LCMapStringWithFallback with LCMAP_LOWERCASE to get lowercase map\n   g. For each character 0-255:\n      - If CT_UPPER (0x01): set 0x10 flag, store uppercase mapped char\n      - If CT_LOWER (0x02): set 0x20 flag, store lowercase mapped char  \n      - Otherwise: store 0\n3. If GetCPInfo fails (fallback to ASCII):\n   a. For 'A'-'Z' (0x41-0x5A): set 0x10 flag, store lowercase equivalent\n   b. For 'a'-'z' (0x61-0x7A): set 0x20 flag, store uppercase equivalent\n   c. Others: store 0\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns: void\n\nGlobals Modified:\n  g_abCharTypeTable - Character type flags (0x10=upper, 0x20=lower)\n  g_abCaseMapTable - Case conversion mapping table\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x100 - LCMAP_UPPERCASE flag for LCMapString\n  0x200 - LCMAP_LOWERCASE flag for LCMapString\n  0x10 - Uppercase character flag in g_abCharTypeTable\n  0x20 - Lowercase character flag in g_abCharTypeTable\n  0x01 - CT_UPPER bit in character type word\n  0x02 - CT_LOWER bit in character type word\n\nCalled By: SetCodePageCharacterTypeTable",
