      "name": "CrtInitializeCharTypeTable",
      "signature": "void CrtInitializeCharTypeTable(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes CRT character type table if not already initialized.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check g_fCrtEnvInitialized flag for prior initialization\n2. If already initialized (non-zero), skip and return\n3. Call SetCodePageCharacterTypeTable(-3) to configure MB character types\n4. Set g_fCrtEnvInitialized = 1 to mark as initialized\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Thread-safe via one-time initialization pattern\n  - Magic number -3 passed to SetCodePageCharacterTypeTable selects default code page\n\nGlobal Variables:\n  g_fCrtEnvInitialized (0x6fa400f8) - bool flag guarding one-time initialization\n\nCalled By:\n  CrtSetupEnvironmentArray - during environment setup\n  CRT_ParseCommandLineArgs - during command line parsing",
