      "name": "InitializeBucketGroup",
      "signature": "int InitializeBucketGroup(SmallBlockHeapContext * pHeapContext)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Initializes a bucket group for small-block heap memory allocation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read bucket table base pointer from pHeapContext->pBucketTable\n2. Count leading zeros in availability bitmap to determine bucket index\n3. Calculate bucket descriptor offset: bucketIndex * 0x204 + 0x144 + bucketTable\n4. Initialize 63 doubly-linked list head nodes as self-referential\n5. Calculate virtual memory address: bucketIndex * 0x8000 + pHeapContext->pMemoryBase\n6. Call VirtualAlloc for 0x8000 bytes with MEM_COMMIT and PAGE_READWRITE\n7. On allocation failure, return -1\n8. Initialize 8 memory blocks of 0x1000 bytes each with sentinel markers\n9. Set usable size fields to 0xFF0 bytes per block\n10. Link blocks via forward and backward pointers for free list\n11. Link first block to bucket descriptor list head at offset 0x1F8\n12. Link last block at offset 0x7000 to same list head\n13. Clear allocation count at bucketTable+0x44+bucketIndex*4\n14. Set initialized flag at bucketTable+0xC4+bucketIndex*4\n15. Increment group count at bucketTable+0x43\n16. If first group initialized, set bit 0 in pHeapContext->dwInitFlags\n17. Clear bucket availability bit in pHeapContext->dwAvailabilityBitmap\n\nParameters:\npHeapContext - SmallBlockHeapContext pointer containing heap configuration\n  dwFlags: General heap flags\n  dwInitFlags: Initialization status flags (bit 0 = has initialized groups)\n  dwAvailabilityBitmap: Bits cleared as buckets are initialized\n  pMemoryBase: Virtual memory base address for block allocations\n  pBucketTable: Pointer to bucket table base\n\nReturns:\n>= 0: Bucket index that was initialized (0-31)\n-1: VirtualAlloc failed to allocate memory\n\nMemory Layout per 0x1000 byte block:\nOffset  Size  Field         Description\n0x00    4     dwSentinel    Block start sentinel (-1)\n0x04    4     dwUsableSize  Usable bytes (0xFF0)\n0x08    4     pFlink        Forward link pointer\n0x0C    4     pBlink        Backward link pointer\n0xFF0   4     dwEndSize     End usable size (0xFF0)\n0xFF4   4     dwEndSentinel End sentinel (-1)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x204: Size of bucket descriptor structure\n0x144: Offset to first bucket descriptor in table\n0x8000: Virtual allocation size (32KB per bucket group)\n0x1000: Block size (4KB)\n0xFF0: Usable space per block (4080 bytes)\n0x3F: Number of list heads to initialize (63)\n0x1F8: Offset to main free list head in bucket descriptor",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
