      "name": "CRT_InitializeSmallBlockHeap",
      "signature": "void * * CRT_InitializeSmallBlockHeap(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "CRT Small Block Heap Region Initialization\n\nAllocates and initializes a new Small Block Heap (SBH) region for the CRT heap system.\nThis is the \"new\" SBH implementation using VirtualAlloc-backed memory regions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if this is the first SBH allocation (g_dwSbhFirstAllocation == -1)\n   - If first: use static g_SmallBlockHeapListHead as region header\n   - Otherwise: allocate 0x2020 byte header from g_hCrtHeap\n2. Reserve 4MB virtual address space via VirtualAlloc(MEM_RESERVE)\n3. Commit initial 64KB (0x10000) via VirtualAlloc(MEM_COMMIT)\n4. If first allocation, initialize list head/tail pointers to self-reference\n5. Otherwise, insert new region into doubly-linked list:\n   - pRegion->pNext = &g_SmallBlockHeapListHead\n   - pRegion->pPrev = g_pSmallBlockHeapListTail\n   - Update tail->pNext and global tail pointer\n6. Initialize region header fields:\n   - Offset 0x14: pRegionEnd = pBaseAddr + 0x400000 (4MB limit)\n   - Offset 0x0C: pNextFreeGroup = pHeader + 0x98 (first page descriptor)\n   - Offset 0x10: pBaseAddr = VirtualAlloc result\n   - Offset 0x08: pCurrentGroup = pHeader + 0x18 (page descriptor array start)\n7. Initialize 1024 (0x400) page descriptors (8 bytes each):\n   - First 16: dwFreeUnits = 0xF0 (240 free units), dwMaxUnits = 0xF1 (241)\n   - Remaining: dwFreeUnits = 0xFFFFFFFF (uncommitted), dwMaxUnits = 0xF1\n8. Zero the committed 64KB region via memset\n9. Initialize 16 committed pages (0x1000 bytes each):\n   - Set page header: pFirstFreeBlock = &page[8], dwFreeBytes = 0xF0 (240)\n   - Set sentinel byte at offset 0xF8 to 0xFF\n10. Return pointer to region header (success) or NULL (failure)\n\nParameters:\n  None (uses globals)\n\nReturns:\n  void** - Pointer to SBH region header on success\n  NULL   - On allocation failure (VirtualAlloc or HeapAlloc failed)\n\nGlobals Read:\n  g_dwSbhFirstAllocation (0x6fa1e540) - Flag: -1 if first allocation\n  g_hCrtHeap (0x6fa3ffc4) - CRT heap handle for header allocation\n  g_SmallBlockHeapListHead (0x6fa1e530) - Doubly-linked list head\n\nGlobals Modified:\n  g_SmallBlockHeapListHead - Updated if first allocation\n  g_pSmallBlockHeapListTail (0x6fa1e534) - Updated to new region\n\nSBH Region Header Layout (0x2020 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field              Description\n  0x00    4     pNext              Next region in list (or &g_SmallBlockHeapListHead)\n  0x04    4     pPrev              Previous region in list\n  0x08    4     pCurrentGroup      Current page descriptor for allocation\n  0x0C    4     pNextFreeGroup     Next group with free pages\n  0x10    4     pBaseAddr          Base of 4MB reserved region\n  0x14    4     pRegionEnd         End of 4MB region (pBase + 0x400000)\n  0x18    8192  PageDescriptors[1024]  Array of page descriptors\n\nPage Descriptor (8 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field        Description\n  0x00    4     dwFreeUnits  Free allocation units (0xFFFFFFFF = uncommitted)\n  0x04    4     dwMaxUnits   Maximum units for this page size class (0xF1)\n\nPage Header (at start of each 4KB page):\n  Offset  Size  Field           Description\n  0x00    4     pFirstFreeBlock Pointer to first free block in page\n  0x04    4     dwFreeBytes     Available bytes (starts at 0xF0 = 240)\n  0xF8    1     bSentinel       Sentinel byte (0xFF marks page as initialized)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x2020 - Region header size (32 bytes header + 8192 bytes descriptors)\n  0x400000 - 4MB reserved virtual address space per region\n  0x10000 - 64KB initial commit (16 pages)\n  0x1000 - 4KB page size\n  0x400 - 1024 page descriptors per region\n  0xF0 - 240 free units per initialized page\n  0xF1 - 241 max units constant\n  0x2000 - MEM_RESERVE flag for VirtualAlloc\n  0x1000 - MEM_COMMIT flag for VirtualAlloc\n  0x8000 - MEM_RELEASE flag for VirtualFree\n\nError Handling:\n  - HeapAlloc failure: Returns NULL immediately\n  - VirtualAlloc reserve failure: Frees header if allocated, returns NULL\n  - VirtualAlloc commit failure: Releases reserved region, frees header, returns NULL\n\nRegister Usage (Assembly):\n  ESI - Region header pointer (lpMem in decompiler)\n  EDI - VirtualAlloc base address (lpAddress)\n  EBX - Committed size constant (0x10000)\n  EBP - Loop counter / VirtualAlloc function pointer",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
