      "name": "FindSmallBlockHeader",
      "signature": "byte * FindSmallBlockHeader(byte * pbAddress, dword * * ppHeapNode, dword * pdwPageBase)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Searches small block heap linked list to find which node contains the given address.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Start with g_SmallBlockHeapListHead as current node\n2. Loop through linked list comparing address against node memory bounds:\n   - If pbAddress > node[4] (base) AND pbAddress < node[5] (end), found containing node\n   - Otherwise advance to next node via node[0] (next pointer)\n   - If wrapped back to list head, address not in any small block heap - return NULL\n3. Validate address alignment: must be 16-byte aligned (pbAddress & 0xF == 0)\n4. Validate page offset: must be >= 0x100 from page base ((pbAddress & 0xFFF) >= 0x100)\n5. Output heap node pointer via ppHeapNode\n6. Calculate page base as (pbAddress & 0xFFFFF000) and output via pdwPageBase\n7. Calculate and return block header address:\n   blockIndex = ((pbAddress - pageBase - 0x100) >> 4) + 8\n   return pageBase + blockIndex\n\nParameters:\n  pbAddress    - Address to search for in small block heaps (byte *)\n  ppHeapNode   - Output: pointer to heap node containing address (dword **)\n  pdwPageBase  - Output: page base address (pbAddress & 0xFFFFF000) (dword *)\n\nReturns:\n  byte * - Block header address if found in small block heap\n  NULL (0) - Address not found, not 16-byte aligned, or in reserved page header area\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Address below node[4] or above node[5]: not in that heap node\n  - Not 16-byte aligned: invalid small block address\n  - Page offset < 0x100: address is in page header, not allocatable block area\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0xF     - Alignment mask for 16-byte blocks\n  0xFFF   - Page offset mask (4KB page)\n  0x100   - Reserved header size at page start (256 bytes)\n  0xFFFFF000 - Page base mask\n  4       - Shift for 16-byte block index calculation\n\nStructure Layout (Heap Node at g_SmallBlockHeapListHead):\n  Offset  Size  Field       Description\n  0x00    4     pNext       Next node in linked list\n  0x04    4     pPrev       Previous node (unused here)\n  0x08    4     field_8     Unknown\n  0x0C    4     field_C     Unknown\n  0x10    4     pMemBase    Memory region base address\n  0x14    4     pMemEnd     Memory region end address\n\nGlobals Referenced:\n  g_SmallBlockHeapListHead @ 0x6fa1e530 - Circular linked list head of heap nodes",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:d9739637e22d71ed7283b5bc68a6c4ac",
