      "name": "FreeSmallBlock",
      "signature": "void FreeSmallBlock(void * pSmallBlockHeapNode, uint dwPageAddress, byte * pbBlockHeader)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Returns a small memory block to the small block heap (SBH) free pool.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate page descriptor index from page address:\n   index = (dwPageAddress - heapBaseAddress) >> 12 (4KB page granularity)\n2. Access 8-byte page descriptor at [pSmallBlockHeapNode + 0x18 + index*8]:\n   - Offset 0: Free block count (int)\n   - Offset 4: Page status flags (int)\n3. Add freed block count (*pbBlockHeader) to descriptor's free count\n4. Clear block header byte (*pbBlockHeader = 0)\n5. Set descriptor status to 0xF1 (page contains free blocks)\n6. If page becomes fully free (free count == 0xF0):\n   a. Increment global deferred page counter\n   b. If deferred count reaches 0x20 (32 pages), trigger reclamation\n\nParameters:\n  pSmallBlockHeapNode (void *) - Pointer to small block heap node structure\n    - Offset 0x10: Base address of heap region\n    - Offset 0x18: Start of page descriptor array (8 bytes per page)\n  dwPageAddress (uint) - Memory address of page containing block\n  pbBlockHeader (byte *) - Pointer to block header containing freed block count\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x18 - Offset to page descriptor array in heap node\n  0x10 - Offset to base address in heap node\n  0xC (12) - Bit shift for 4KB page alignment (4096 = 2^12)\n  0x8 - Page descriptor entry size (8 bytes)\n  0xF0 (240) - Max blocks per page (page fully free when count reaches this)\n  0xF1 (241) - Page status: has free blocks available\n  0x20 (32) - Deferred page reclaim threshold\n  0x10 (16) - Pages to reclaim per SBH_ReclaimDeferredPages call\n\nGlobals Referenced:\n  g_nSbhDeferredPageCount @ 0x6fa3ec64 - Count of fully-free pages awaiting reclaim\n\nCalled By:\n  CrtFreeMemory - When freeing memory from small block heap (type 2)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:ab1eb8b21e2bded2678160ac668c3175",
