      "name": "SBH_AllocateFromRegionList",
      "signature": "void * SBH_AllocateFromRegionList(dword dwBlockCount)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "SBH Small Block Heap Allocator - Region List Traversal\n\nAllocates memory from the CRT Small Block Heap (SBH) Type 2 allocator by\ntraversing the circular region list to find a page with sufficient free space.\nCalled by CrtAllocateMemory and CrtCallocMemory with dwBlockCount = size / 16.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Start at cached region header (PTR_g_SmallBlockHeapListHead_6fa20550)\n2. For each region with committed pages (piVar8[4] != -1):\n   a. Get current page descriptor from region->pCurrentGroup (offset 0x08)\n   b. Calculate page base address from descriptor offset\n   c. First loop: Scan from current descriptor to end of array (piVar8 + 0x806)\n      - Check if page has enough free units: *pdwPageDesc >= dwBlockCount\n      - Check if max units allows allocation: pdwPageDesc[1] > dwBlockCount\n      - Call FUN_6fa17a71 to allocate within page\n      - On success, update cached region and current descriptor\n   d. Second loop: Scan from descriptor array start to saved descriptor\n      - Same allocation logic as first loop\n3. Advance to next region via linked list (piVar8 = *piVar8)\n4. If wrapped to start, find or create region with uncommitted pages:\n   a. Search for region with uncommitted pages (ppuVar10[4] == 0xFFFFFFFF)\n      or region with free group pointer (ppuVar10[3] != 0)\n   b. If no suitable region, call CRT_InitializeSmallBlockHeap\n   c. If new region created, initialize first page and return allocation\n5. If found region with uncommitted pages:\n   a. Count consecutive uncommitted pages (max 16)\n   b. Commit pages via VirtualAlloc with MEM_COMMIT (0x1000)\n   c. Initialize page headers with free list and sentinel bytes\n   d. Update region free group pointer\n   e. Allocate from first newly committed page\n\nParameters:\n  dwBlockCount (dword) - Number of 16-byte blocks to allocate (size/16)\n\nReturns:\n  void* - Pointer to allocated memory (page base + 0x100)\n  NULL  - If allocation failed (VirtualAlloc failed or no memory)\n\nGlobals:\n  PTR_g_SmallBlockHeapListHead_6fa20550 - Cached current region header\n  g_SmallBlockHeapListHead - Doubly-linked list head of SBH regions\n\nSBH Region Header Layout (0x2020 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field              Description\n  0x00    4     pNext              Next region in circular list\n  0x04    4     pPrev              Previous region in list\n  0x08    4     pCurrentGroup      Current page descriptor for scan\n  0x0C    4     pNextFreeGroup     Next group with uncommitted pages\n  0x10    4     pBaseAddr          Base of 4MB reserved region\n  0x14    4     pRegionEnd         End marker (pBase + 0x400000)\n  0x18    8192  PageDescriptors    Array of 1024 page descriptors\n\nPage Descriptor (8 bytes):\n  Offset  Field        Description\n  0x00    dwFreeUnits  Free allocation units (0xFFFFFFFF = uncommitted)\n  0x04    dwMaxUnits   Maximum units for page (0xF1 = 241)\n\nPage Header (at 4KB page start):\n  Offset  Field           Description\n  0x00    pFirstFree      Pointer to first free block\n  0x04    dwFreeBytes     Available bytes (initial 0xF0 = 240)\n  0x08    bBlockSize      Size class for this allocation\n  0xF8    bSentinel       Sentinel byte (0xFF marks initialized)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x806  - Page descriptor array end offset (1024 * 2 dwords / 4)\n  0x400  - 1024 pages per region (4MB / 4KB)\n  0x1000 - 4KB page size and MEM_COMMIT flag\n  0xF0   - 240 initial free units per page\n  0xF1   - 241 max units constant\n  0x100  - Offset from page base to user data (piVar8 + 0x40)\n\nCallers: CrtAllocateMemory, CrtCallocMemory",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:de76025ed2839a23b964285c7e0d5701",
